# Agent documentation

This repo is documented for coding agents, not just humans.

- Start from `AGENTS.md`.
- Architecture lives in `docs/ai/architecture.md`. Scoring rules live in `docs/ai/taste-engine.md`.
- If you change pipeline flow, scoring, resolution, API shape, or ingredient persistence (seed JSON vs Turso), update those docs in the same change.
- Do not add UI beyond dish-name → taste profile unless the user asks.
